# Local secrets for `npx wrangler pages dev dist`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and paste your real key there. `.dev.vars` is
# gitignored — never commit it, and never put a real key in this example file.
#
# Set exactly ONE provider key. Gemini wins if both are present.
#
# In production, do NOT use this file: set the same variable in the Cloudflare
# Pages dashboard (Settings -> Environment variables) with "Encrypt" checked.

# --- Option A: Google Gemini (has a free tier) ---
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey — it starts with "AIza".
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza-your-key-here

# --- Option B: Anthropic Claude (no free tier; pay as you go) ---
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-your-key-here

# Optional: override the model for whichever provider is active.
# Gemini defaults to gemini-2.5-flash (250 requests/day on the free tier).
# Use gemini-2.5-flash-lite for 1000/day at lower answer quality.
# CHAT_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash-lite
